\n\nThis skips item 0, item 10, item 20, etc. — one item at each page boundary.\n\n**The fix:** Remove the `+ 1`\n\n```\noffset = page * pageSize\n```\n\nThe `+ 1` appears to be a copy-paste error from 1-based pagination logic (where pages start at 1) or a misunderstanding of 0-based indexing. With 0-based pages, the offset should simply be `page * pageSize`.","ttft_ms":6171,"type":"result","duration_ms":7817,"uuid":"b616b8b8-39da-48d2-8227-b4eac4f67241","ttft_stream_ms":766,"time_to_request_ms":111,"first_content_frame_ms":766,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":10,"outputTokens":830,"cacheReadInputTokens":6376,"cacheCreationInputTokens":543,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0058836,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":561,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":543,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-12T05:14:51.381Z"}